OL,3,A'Insufficient funds' to pay Brewdog
OL,4,Acreditors after takeover deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral creditors of collapsed Scottish
OL,7,Fbeer giant Brewdog are not expected to
OL,8,Freceive anything from the
OL,9,Fadministration process.
OL,11,FA report from administrators
OL,12,FAlixPartners said there were
OL,13,F"insufficient funds" for payouts from
OL,14,FBrewdog's retail arm - including #2.4m
OL,15,Fowed to HMRC for unpaid VAT.
OL,17,FBrewdog had also owed #489,000 for
OL,18,Fwages and holiday pay, which will not
OL,19,Fbe paid through the administration
OL,20,Fprocess. Staff have instead received
OL,21,Fcompensation from the UK government's
OL,22,FInsolvency Service.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
