OL,3,A'Insufficient funds' to pay Brewdog
OL,4,Acreditors after takeover deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Aberdeenshire-based brewer had more
OL,7,Fthan #500m of debts when it was sold in
OL,8,FMarch to US drinks firm Tilray in a
OL,9,F#33m rescue deal.
